", "conf": "mid", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Jada+Weazel+Skin", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Jada+Weazel+Skin", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Jada+Weazel+Skin", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Jada+Weazel+Skin", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/1693940527", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Jada+Weazel+Skin", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Jada+Weazel+Skin&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2023 EMI Recorded Music Australia Pty Ltd"]}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 7, "low": 3}, "transcripts": [{"start": "01:33:16", "end": "01:33:35", "text": "Yo, cause just pulled up to the studio where you at. Fucking me and OGK just started on some shit. On the real? It's crazy, bro. I was trying to counter-side it and shit, but let me go and there's a guy we put in, because anyways, I'm seeing you."}, {"start": "01:55:45", "end": "01:56:00", "text": "I ain't so horrible until the field I can border. Almost none of the snuff on the golfers. Sauce man on the high road, 647, he dunk with ease. FN on the piece, he gave me that shout, had to get in this piece."}, {"start": "01:58:14", "end": "01:58:32", "text": "Backstory. This is bringing, like, a lot of memories. I love these types of questions. It always brings tears to my eyes. I feel so many different things from it that I can't put into words. Oh, great question. Record collections and recollections. Out of the box. On FBi Radio."}, {"start": "01:58:41", "end": "02:00:00", "text": "Hey it's Nick Hibbs with you here on FBi Radio 94.5 streaming online on the podcast. This is Out of the Box. It's the place where every Thursday from 12 to 1 we dig through the crates of a guest's memory pulling out music stories and special moments of someone's life and putting them on the turntable to be heard. Today I am broadcasting from Redfern which is on unceded Gadigal land and I'd like to pay my respects to Gadigal elders past and present and recognize the ongoing colonial violence committed across this country. Out of the Box is a show where we dive deep into the guest record box and pull out the stories of the music they love First Nations people have been telling stories across country for millennia and I'm so privileged to be able to do that here today I would like to extend that respect to any First Nations person listening in Wherever you're tuning in from in so-called Sydney, the land always was, always will be Aboriginal land In a digital age where misinformation propagates, originality thrives Our guest on the show today, Gigi's Theory, creates a space for the culturally curious. Deep diving into the pockets of music, fashion and art, she identifies tastemakers highlighting black art and sounds. Her artisanal commentary has solidified as her a trusted voice within the Melbourne art scene. Gigi joins us here today to chat about competing with the algorithm, her hopes..."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:05:36"}, "track": {"title": "It's Just a Flesh Wound, Darling", "artists": [{"name": "Exek"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:17:22"}, "track": {"title": "Leo", "artists": [{"name": "Milan Ring"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:42:00"}, "track": {"title": "Tacones Rojox Vs Starships", "artists": [{"name": "Dj Ksa Officialx"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:58:00"}, "track": {"title": "Стать дождем (KalashnikoFF Remix)", "artists": [{"name": "Артем Тото & KalashnikoFF"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": t